o=A.u("Avinex Escrow provides a digital escrow service that: holds funds on behalf of transacting parties; releases funds upon fulfillment of agreed conditions; and facilitates dispute resolution between users. Avinex is not a marketplace, but an intermediary platform.",e8,e8,e8,e8,B.aT,e8,e8)
