B.ap_=new A.eO("1. Nature of Service","Avinex Escrow provides a digital escrow service that holds funds on behalf of transacting parties, releases funds upon fulfillment of agreed conditions, and facilitates dispute resolution. Avinex is not a marketplace, but an intermediary platform.",null)
B.Z=new A.cI(null,14,null,null)
B.ap1=new A.eO("2. Eligibility",u.ac,null)
B.aoZ=new A.eO("3. User Accounts","You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and all activities under your account. Notify us immediately of any unauthorized access. Avinex may suspend or terminate accounts for fraudulent activity, misrepresentation, or violation of these Terms.",null)
B.ap5=new A.eO("4. Escrow Transaction Process","Buyer funds escrow \u2192 Funds are held securely \u2192 Seller delivers goods/services \u2192 Buyer confirms OR dispute is raised \u2192 Funds are released or refunded. Avinex does not guarantee product quality or delivery and does not act as buyer or seller.",null)
B.ap4=new A.eO("5. Transaction Finality","Once released, transactions are final and irreversible. Users must verify their satisfaction before confirming release.",null)
B.ap6=new A.eO("6. Payments and Fees","Payments are processed via third-party providers (e.g., Paystack). Applicable fees are disclosed before transaction confirmation. Users are responsible for bank charges and applicable taxes.",null)
B.apb=new A.eO("7. Withdrawals",u.cp,null)
B.ap9=new A.eO("8. Dispute Resolution","Users may raise disputes for non-delivery, defective goods/services, or contractual disagreements. Avinex reviews evidence from both parties and determines outcomes fairly. All dispute outcomes are final and binding.",null)
B.ap3=new A.eO("9. Prohibited Activities","You must not use the platform for illegal transactions, engage in fraud or money laundering, provide false information, or attempt to bypass escrow mechanisms. Violations may result in account suspension, fund restriction, or reporting to authorities.",null)
B.ap2=new A.eO("10. Limitation of Liability",u.ao,null)
B.aoY=new A.eO("11. Indemnification",u.g,null)
B.aoW=new A.eO("12. Governing Law & Amendments","These Terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. Disputes with Avinex shall be resolved first through negotiation, then through Nigerian courts. We may update these Terms periodically \u2014 continued use constitutes acceptance.",null)
B.es=new A.cI(null,22,null,null)
B.apd=new A.eO("Privacy Policy \u2014 Introduction","This Privacy Policy explains how Avinex collects, uses, and protects your personal data in compliance with the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 (NDPA).",null)
B.ap8=new A.eO("13. Information We Collect","Personal Data: name, email address, phone number. Financial Data: transaction records, wallet balances, payment references. Technical Data: IP address, device information, session data.",null)
B.apg=new A.eO("14. Legal Basis for Processing",u.x,null)
B.ap7=new A.eO("15. How We Use Your Data","We use your data to provide escrow services, process payments, authenticate users, prevent fraud, resolve disputes, and improve platform functionality.",null)
B.aoX=new A.eO("16. Data Sharing","We may share data with payment processors (e.g., Paystack), regulatory authorities when required by law, and service providers under confidentiality agreements. We do not sell personal data.",null)
B.apa=new A.eO("17. Data Retention & Security","We retain data for as long as necessary for services, Nigerian legal compliance, and audit purposes. We implement encryption, secure authentication, restricted access controls, and server-side financial processing.",null)
B.apc=new A.eO("18. Your Rights (NDPA 2023)","Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023, you have the right to access your data, correct inaccuracies, request deletion where applicable, withdraw consent, and lodge complaints with the Nigeria Data Protection Commission.",null)
B.ap0=new A.eO("19. Third-Party Services & Cross-Border Transfers","Our platform integrates with Paystack (payments). These services have their own privacy policies. Where data is transferred outside Nigeria, appropriate safeguards are implemented.",null)
B.ape=new A.eO("20. Children's Privacy",u.cm,null)
B.apf=new A.eO("21. Contact & Complaints","For data-related inquiries, contact our support team through the platform. You may also lodge complaints with the Nigeria Data Protection Commission. Effective Date: May 4, 2026.",null)
